Name: AMap Signal Countdown
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Personal AMap 16.11.1 three-signal countdown HUD with SQLite history by entering road, direction blacklists, historical cycle prediction, and cycling speed advice. Reads only in-process native travel state; no OCR, network interception, GPS/Core Location collection, or geospatial distance inference.
